{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102504","id":2321109008,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6KWVAQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102504","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102504.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102504.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102504","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102504/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102504/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102504/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b61499353f23ff41d6e8958dc2324388e607df40","number":102504,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix error when embedded popup is closed while resizing","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes #100613\r\n- Fixes #102357\r\n\r\nWhen resizing the game window, Godot closes the embedded popup window. The `print error` was triggered because on resize, the `_sub_window_update` is called deferred, but when it is executed, the window was already closed.\r\n\r\nReplacing the `ERR_FAIL_COND` by a simple check fixed the issue.\r\n\r\nTested with or without the Floating Window, on Linux and Windows.\r\n\r\nNote 1: I was able to reproduce the issue with the MRP from #100613 on Windows only and without the Floating Window.\r\nNote 2: I was able to reproduce the issue with the MRP from #102357 on Linux only and with the Floating Window.\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscription